ClockView class

	instanceVariableNames: ''!





!ClockView class methodsFor: 'instance creation'!



open



	| topView clockView |

	topView _ StandardSystemView new.

	topView label: 'Clock'.

	clockView _ self new.

	clockView borderWidth: 2.

	clockView insideColor: Form white.

	topView addSubView: clockView.

	topView controller open



	"ClockView open"! !



!ClockView class methodsFor: 'class initialization'!



initialize



	| text |

	NumberForms _ Array new: 12.

	1 to: 12 do:

		[:number |

		text _ number printString asText.

		text emphasizeFrom: 1 to: text size with: 11.

		NumberForms at: number put: text asParagraph asForm]



	"ClockView initialize"! !



ClockView initialize!

